              <lg xml:id="m-5147f0a4-c1e9-4b9b-b028-5cb063669b50">
                <l xml:id="m-71520508-f374-4fb3-a511-ff5bc4f94604" facs="#m-369258ba-d93b-4ed2-b704-aa93151c7857" label="text-like">for Feasts which are not I. class.</l><l xml:id="m-2cb15d14-e701-41b5-8241-861383d1009c" facs="#m-8c548672-658e-4a41-ab24-bf16381881cc" label="ambiguous">270x</l><l xml:id="m-40d16923-e986-4d07-b6c0-f01ba2f6b282" facs="#m-831e3704-5c1c-4d45-8a89-9f6e9e0c9904" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Allelúia. p. 236.</l><l xml:id="m-81bbd593-eefe-4170-b8d3-2fd02b506a7b" facs="#m-a81cc03a-0157-4cd9-a15b-0171ab376d38" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 72. I. Quam bónus Israel. YV. 1-9, p. 640.</l><l xml:id="m-b85777a9-868c-4d0f-95d9-2d325f857809" facs="#m-5a3fa9e4-1815-425e-af70-2f8fad7ed74d" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 72. n. Ideo convertétur. YY. 10-17.</l><l xml:id="m-cc771214-918d-4281-b2a1-0c46a8c8e99e" facs="#m-d9b524d9-5382-462e-85f7-907ab93e76de" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 72. M1. Verúmtamen. YF. 18-28.</l><l xml:id="m-a4caef1a-bcb6-48eb-b523-7c8166616466" facs="#m-e4446b9e-808f-404b-b18e-5fbb78abb7db" label="ambiguous">An¬</l><l xml:id="m-8b460dde-bd51-4585-aae3-266f26972760" facs="#m-37de1af0-ff2d-468f-8bf4-d93dc7615533" label="ambiguous">tiphon.</l><l xml:id="m-a3a8618b-fb5a-42cc-b3b2-3efc82cfb4c0" facs="#m-1d75d6bd-56e6-4700-a789-820526a55d57" label="lyrics-like">Quam bó-nus Isra-el Dé-us his qui récto sunt córde!</l><l xml:id="m-fc25c97d-20e5-414c-8ccb-c379903b0530" facs="#m-fba7f1e5-fe05-4fe2-afaf-a6120262cf55" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Allelúia, allelúia, alleluia. p. 239.</l><l xml:id="m-6bb3e1c1-ecef-4589-bb73-ed127f650a53" facs="#m-58946026-89c6-4944-b08c-e5d9fe4b5a5e" label="text-like">THURSDAY AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-391fd94e-f182-41e0-b5fa-f1e7d21d1e12" facs="#m-25e7b118-a26a-4433-8831-be9779d71f1c" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-3a246bc0-de94-44af-9071-903fd05467d8" facs="#m-af38fb99-6bde-4789-9ec9-eaa09af89263" label="ambiguous">5. a</l><l xml:id="m-d30c7375-dc54-48fb-bbb2-9823cddda266" facs="#m-672e483a-dedb-4443-90ad-4c4d262b8e68" label="lyrics-like">Emor ésto. Euo ua c.</l><l xml:id="m-4b80bcac-c29e-4b91-8942-9ede1e476753" facs="#m-a64ba45b-10ee-4124-8acd-f74a9d947763" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Allelúia. p. 241.</l><l xml:id="m-e8b529df-d7e6-443e-bc60-8712379ca934" facs="#m-11a64af6-9501-4e37-836a-964398e5b5e6" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 73. I. Ut quid, Déus, repulisti. YY. 1-10 </l><l xml:id="m-d7bb532a-4184-45fd-975c-ac97d8db31fb" facs="#m-e4ec91cc-c2ae-44a6-bce2-ade83c7e02af" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 73. H. Usquequo, Déus. XY. 11-18.</l><l xml:id="m-5b1f30a2-4194-4420-aaae-c045303c089e" facs="#m-f6d94007-7165-4ee4-b20a-2b7b42f5031b" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 73. Hl. Mémor ésto. YY. 19-24.</l><l xml:id="m-5f74d314-6663-4cac-b3bc-a7b01162f48f" facs="#m-2f8dc1e7-9eb8-4a05-97b1-e8724ead502c" label="ambiguous">An¬</l><l xml:id="m-cbfd574e-01a7-4864-8533-42d6831c58ff" facs="#m-f9faba49-9b5d-46ad-a11a-f3af9c83f728" label="ambiguous">tiphon.</l><l xml:id="m-64959420-d778-40fa-8025-07e0c32be54d" facs="#m-a06ab95f-45c4-480a-a3ea-715c908145e7" label="lyrics-like">Memor ésto congrega-ti-ónis tú-ae, Dómi-ne, quam</l><l xml:id="m-6ed1c0a5-a39d-4697-9515-783023d574f1" facs="#m-a1a48a03-143b-4edf-90d4-5548468dc3b5" label="lyrics-like">possedísti ab iní-ti-o</l><l xml:id="m-ccee9abd-d845-47ff-ac73-16354c2940a5" facs="#m-c91872bd-f957-4792-9a34-0243eb2b70cd" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Allelúia, alleluia, alleluia. p. 244.</l><l xml:id="m-f692c5a4-ac67-4100-9f06-dfc73bdbac7d" facs="#m-6ba2d7ba-eab9-45c2-a126-d962345238af" label="text-like">THURSDAY AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-8aec3bd3-22ce-44d9-9d12-03b3d395430d" facs="#m-82733b98-def4-4c13-8124-f8fe57a8c549" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-e6714f79-cb06-403c-9117-385a1aded9c2" facs="#m-ebe182ed-ff1b-42bf-8971-6adf91808f64" label="ambiguous">6.1</l><l xml:id="m-e27e5bf2-d56c-4cb7-81fd-fd2af5af818d" facs="#m-16d8640b-c3c0-4bfd-9ff1-7b6699c5c02c" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-53722e93-7e19-4eef-bfb9-1dfcf4bbdd8f" facs="#m-390112fe-ee97-431f-9dbf-41e6ee616b90" label="lyrics-like">Nvo-cábimus. Eu o u a e¬</l><l xml:id="m-c39c6ef2-5e7c-4d77-b1c6-2451cfcae17a" facs="#m-63e489f3-a5e6-4554-9dba-069ead9d3321" label="lyrics-like">In Paschal Time. Ant. Allelúia. p. 246.</l><l xml:id="m-87237023-d5ac-4327-ad86-a9a1b1a9b704" facs="#m-4a228a62-8ee3-4bc1-82d4-f67567fee665" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 74. Confitébimur tibi. p. 646.</l><l xml:id="m-bc4a8723-d71a-464e-8044-810ac5ee6bea" facs="#m-b683c3ee-7524-4b5a-839a-eb0a2702afa3" label="lyrics-like">Ps. 75. I. Nótus in Judaéa. YY. 1-6, p. 647.</l><l xml:id="m-53d9c745-0b0c-4865-8cc3-03c0c8e68046" facs="#m-4d88f991-48ab-46f3-b8ab-347c5dffec99" label="ambiguous">Ps. 75. M. Tu terribilis es. YV. 7-12.</l><l xml:id="m-cc7f58ee-1143-4949-aa43-c754a5132a40" facs="#m-c6db8ef8-1faf-490f-8ee7-28969aa0b828" label="ambiguous">N° 80l. — 14</l></lg>
